# S5-07 fault-time register-context diagnostic pair, 2026-11-15

Purpose: inspect the fault-time state of the additional page fault previously
seen at `rep_movs_alternative+0x11`. These are two independent counted
single-run diagnostics with the schema-v2 execution-observations sidecar. They
are not an automatic series; no comparator was run and they do not accept
S5-07.

